    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "奥！已经天黑了。"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "aliases": [
        "EditorFirstIntroNarrative2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "奥！天已经黑了。",
              "en": "Oh! It was dark."
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "不过那些僵尸并不打算放弃进攻你的房子。",
              "en": "The zomblies, however, are not about to give up their assault on your house."
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "晚上的草坪总是莫名其妙地长处很多墓碑。",
              "en": "There were always a lot of tombstones on the lawn at night for no reason at all."
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "我也不知道这些墓碑是从哪来的。",
              "en": "I don't know where the tombstones came from."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "aliases": [
        "EditorFirstIntroNarrative3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "这些墓碑很让人讨厌吧。",
              "en": "Those tombstones are a real eyesore."
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "我去研究研究它们是怎么来的。",
              "en": "I will go to see how it came."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "aliases": [
        "EditorFirstOutroNarrative2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "我找到墓碑的来源了。",
              "en": "I had found the tombstones's source."
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "它是由僵尸制造的。",
              "en": "It was made by a zombie."
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "那是一只······呃，我从没见过的僵尸。",
              "en": "That's a zombie I've never seen before."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "aliases": [
        "EditorFirstIntroNarrative4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "你见过他？",
              "en": "Have you seen him?"
            }
          },
          {
